/P 69 0 R
/E (As a student-run organization, our members gain hands-on experience producing institutional-quality equity research. This remains the foundation of our curriculum and a key differentiator for our analysts, both in terms of technical development and in standing out during the recruitment process. We complement this with rigorous training, structured mentorship, and a peer environment that holds members to a high standard.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
